# OpenTofu: state, plans and caches never enter git (docs/PLAN.md « Never »).
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.json
.terraform/
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Variable files hold values (some sensitive): only *.tfvars.example is committed.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
